<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    ============================================================
    KernelExtensions PortHackV2 配置示例
    KernelExtensions PortHackV2 Configuration Example
    ============================================================
    定位：剧情资产。每份配置对应一次破解，放 <扩展根>/PortHackV2/ 下。
    Position: story asset. One config per crack, under <extensionRoot>/PortHackV2/.

    启用方式：给玩家挂上存档 flag PortHackV2_<文件名>（不含 .xml）。
    flag 就是"入口牌"：无 flag 程序锁定；出现多个 flag 视为作者配置错误（锁定 + 日志报错）。
    How to enable: set the save flag PortHackV2_<fileName> (without .xml) on the player.
    The flag is the entry token: none means locked; more than one is an authoring error.

    颜色：支持 CustomColor 预设名与动态色（LDTchara / Rainbow / Gradient:…），
    以及 #RGB / #RRGGBB / #AARRGGBB / R,G,B[,A] / XNA 命名色。
    Colors accept CustomColor preset names, dynamic colors, hex, numeric RGB(A) and XNA names.

    本文件是参考示例。为保证 XML 单根校验通过，只保留一个 <PortHackV2Config>；
    其余变体以注释附在文末。
    This is a reference example; variants are listed as comments at the end.
-->
<PortHackV2Config>

  <!-- ── 程序名 / Program name ──
       终端里显示的名字。留空 = PortHackV2。
       Name shown in the terminal. Empty = PortHackV2.
       程序在终端里的注册名 #PORTHACKV2# 不受此处影响。
       The registration name #PORTHACKV2# is not affected by this. -->
  <ProgramName>PortHackV2</ProgramName>

  <!-- ── 界面标题 / Screen title ──
       破解界面左上角显示的文字。留空 = 用第一个协议名。
       Text drawn at the top-left of the window. Empty = the first protocol name. -->
  <Title>SSH Brute Force</Title>

  <!-- ── 根级时长（秒）/ Root-level time (seconds) ──
       Cracking 阶段的总时长 —— 底部进度条走的就是它。留空 = 10。
       Total length of the Cracking phase; the bottom progress bar follows it. Empty = 10.
       多协议并行推进，每个协议由自己的 <StartDelay> 错开启动。
       Protocols run in parallel, staggered by each one's own <StartDelay>. -->
  <Time>30</Time>

  <!-- ── 颜色 / Colours ──
       AccentColor：**立体（多边体）线框**的颜色。留空 / NONE = 白色。
                    The colour of the wireframe solid. Empty or NONE = white.
       ProgressColor：底部总进度条的颜色。留空 / NONE = 跟随 AccentColor。
                      The colour of the bottom progress bar. Empty or NONE = follow AccentColor.
       BackgroundColor：面板背景色。留空 / NONE = 跟随 AccentColor。
                        The panel background colour. Empty or NONE = follow AccentColor.
       三者都支持 CustomColor 预设名与动态色（LDTchara / Rainbow / Gradient:…），
       以及 #RGB / #RRGGBB / #AARRGGBB / R,G,B[,A] / XNA 命名色。
       All three accept CustomColor preset names and dynamic colours, hex, numeric RGB(A) and
       XNA names.
       目标机状态的语义色（满足 / 未满足）仍走主题色，不归这几项管。
       The state colours (met / unmet) still come from the theme and are not affected. -->
  <AccentColor>White</AccentColor>
  <ProgressColor>White</ProgressColor>
  <BackgroundColor>White</BackgroundColor>

  <!-- ── 背景效果 / Background effect ──
       面板背景用的游戏本体现成效果（都不需要自带资源）：
       The background uses the game's built-in effects (no bundled assets needed):
         NONE            不画背景 / no background
         ZoomingDotGrid  中心向外扩散旋转的点阵（PhaseSwift 用的就是它）— 默认
                         expanding dot grid from the centre (the one PhaseSwift uses) — default
         HexGrid         六边形蜂窝网格（原版 KaguyaTrial 用的）
                         hexagonal honeycomb grid (vanilla KaguyaTrial's background)
         Grid            带十字标记的交叉网格 / cross-hatched grid
         DepthDotGrid    多层递归点阵（景深感）/ recursive dot grid with depth
       留空 = ZoomingDotGrid；写别的值 → 记 Warn 并回退 ZoomingDotGrid。
       Empty = ZoomingDotGrid; any other value logs a warning and falls back to it.
       背景随面板一起淡出；锁定屏的文字则是**退出瞬间与背景一起直接消失**（不淡出）。
       The background fades out with the panel; the locked screen's text vanishes instantly
       together with the background instead of fading. -->
  <BackgroundEffect>ZoomingDotGrid</BackgroundEffect>

  <!-- ── 完成文案 / Completion text ──
       成功演出时中央显示的文字，**单行**。留空 = COMPLETE。
       The single line shown in the centre on success. Empty = COMPLETE.
       刻意不做本地化：这个位置是"程序告诉你破解完了"的电子感文字，
       与原版的 PASSWORD / FOUND 同类，任何语言下都用同一串。
       Deliberately not localised: this is the program telling you it is done, in the same
       spirit as vanilla's PASSWORD / FOUND, so every language shows the same string.
       过长会按面板宽度自动缩字号。
       Overlong text is scaled down to fit the panel width. -->
  <CompletionText>COMPLETE</CompletionText>

  <!-- ── 待破解协议 / Protocols ──
       每个 <Protocol> 自带协议名、成功率、启动延迟与两条分支时长。可以放一个或多个，
       多协议并行推进。协议名须已被注册（ssh / ftp / smtp / http 等）。
       Each <Protocol> carries its own name, success rate, start delay and branch durations.
       Protocols run in parallel; the name must already be registered (ssh / ftp / smtp / http).

       <Name>          协议名（必填）
                       Protocol name (required).
       <StartDelay>    本协议在 Cracking 开始后等待多久才启动（秒）；留空 = 0。
                       并行时用它错开各协议的进度条。
                       Seconds to wait after Cracking starts before this protocol begins. Empty = 0.
       <Rng>           百分比 0~100。留空 = 100（必定成功）。
                       Percentage 0~100. Empty = 100 (always succeeds).
                       在本协议启动时掷一次，决定走成功分支还是失败分支；
                       演出上不提前暴露结果（进度条与动画在两条分支上完全一样）。
                       Rolled once when the protocol starts; the presentation never reveals it
                       (both branches look identical, only the duration differs).
                       写错只回退 100 并记 Warn，不会让整份配置失效。
                       A malformed value falls back to 100 with a warning; the config still loads.
       <TimeIfSuccess> 本协议成功分支时长（秒）。留空 = 10；<= 0 = 瞬满。
                       Duration of the success branch (seconds). Empty = 10; <= 0 = instant.
       <TimeIfFail>    本协议失败分支时长（秒）。留空 = 3； <= 0 = 瞬满。
                       Duration of the failure branch (seconds). Empty = 3; <= 0 = instant.
       <OnStart> / <OnComplete> / <OnFail>
                       本协议级别的动作点（相对扩展根）；与根级同名钩子叠加。
                       Protocol-level action hooks (relative to the extension root). -->
  <Protocols>
    <Protocol>
      <Name>ssh</Name>
      <StartDelay>0</StartDelay>
      <Rng>60</Rng>
      <TimeIfSuccess>12</TimeIfSuccess>
      <TimeIfFail>4</TimeIfFail>
      <OnStart>Actions/sshStart.xml</OnStart>
      <OnComplete>Actions/sshDone.xml</OnComplete>
      <OnFail>Actions/sshFail.xml</OnFail>
    </Protocol>
    <Protocol>
      <Name>ftp</Name>
      <StartDelay>3</StartDelay>
      <Rng>90</Rng>
      <TimeIfSuccess>6</TimeIfSuccess>
      <TimeIfFail>3</TimeIfFail>
    </Protocol>
  </Protocols>

  <!-- ── 动画 / Animation ──
       节奏：浮现并加速转 → 加速完匀速 → 总时长到点后急刹（减速）→ 减速完继续匀速慢转。
       Rhythm: fade in while ramping up, steady spin, brake when the total time is up,
       then keep spinning slowly at the idle rate.
       Polyhedron   ：破解时旋转的立体。Tetrahedron / Cube / Octahedron /
                      Dodecahedron / Icosahedron（大小写不敏感）。留空 = Cube。
                      The solid that spins during the crack. Case-insensitive. Empty = Cube.
       SpinUpRatio  ：起转时长占总时长的比例。留空 = 0.1（10%）。
                      Ramp-up duration as a fraction of the total time. Empty = 0.1.
       SpinUpTime   ：起转时长的绝对秒数；写了就以它为准，留空或负数 = 用比例。
                      Absolute ramp-up seconds; overrides the ratio. Empty or negative = use ratio.
       SpinDownTime ：急刹时长（秒）。留空 = 1.7；剩余时间不够时自动截断。
                      Brake duration in seconds. Empty = 1.7; truncated if time runs short. -->
  <Polyhedron>Cube</Polyhedron>
  <SpinUpRatio>0.1</SpinUpRatio>
  <SpinDownTime>1.7</SpinDownTime>

  <!-- ── 结束后行为 / On-finish behaviour ──
       TakeAdmin：成功后是否像原版 PortHack 一样取得目标机管理员权限（把 owner 设为玩家）。
                  留空 = false，即只开端口、不给 admin。
                  Grant admin on the target like vanilla PortHack does. Empty = false.
       AutoExitOnLeave：玩家离开本程序所在节点时是否自动关闭程序。
                        留空 = true（原版 PortHack 行为）；false = 程序跨节点常驻。
                        Close the program when the player leaves the node it runs on.
                        Empty = true (vanilla behaviour); false = keep running across nodes.
       CompleteDelay：成功演出（乱序字 + 上下白线）结束后、退出前的停留秒数。留空 = 5。
                      Seconds to stay on screen after the success sequence. Empty = 5. -->
  <TakeAdmin>true</TakeAdmin>
  <AutoExitOnLeave>true</AutoExitOnLeave>
  <CompleteDelay>5</CompleteDelay>

  <!-- ── 资源占用 / Resource cost ──
       运行本程序占用的内存（MB）。留空 = 246，与原版 PortHack 一致。
       Memory the program occupies, in MB. Empty = 246, matching vanilla PortHack.
       原版 PortHackExe 从不设置 ramCost，取的是引擎默认值 246，这里对齐它。
       Vanilla PortHackExe never sets ramCost, so it uses the engine default of 246. -->
  <RamCost>246</RamCost>

  <!-- ── 前置要求 / Prerequisites ──
       未满足时 Listing 屏对应行显示为 lockedColor，全部满足后自动进入破解。
       Unmet rows are drawn in the locked colour; the crack starts automatically once all are met.
       RequireOpenPortsBefore 是端口协议名列表，每个协议一行。
       RequireOpenPortsBefore is a list of port protocol names, one row each. -->
  <RequireOpenPortsBefore>
    <string>ftp</string>
  </RequireOpenPortsBefore>
  <RequireSolveFirewall>false</RequireSolveFirewall>
  <RequireProxyOverload>false</RequireProxyOverload>

  <!-- ── 动作点 / Action hooks（根级 / root level）──
       相对扩展根目录的动作文件路径。路径越界或文件不存在时跳过并记 Warn，不中断流程。
       Paths are relative to the extension root. Out-of-bounds or missing files are skipped
       with a warning and never interrupt the crack.
       OnStart   ：Cracking 开始时（每个协议的 <OnStart> 则在各自启动时）
                   When Cracking starts (each protocol's own <OnStart> fires when it starts).
       OnComplete：整体收尾时（总时长跑满，固定走成功演出）
                   At the final settle (the total time elapsed, which always ends in success).
       根级没有 OnFail：根级不掷 RNG，总时长跑满即视为整体收尾，
       某个协议有没有破开由该协议自己的 <OnFail> 表达。
       There is no root-level OnFail: the root has no RNG, so the total time running out always
       settles. Whether a protocol broke is expressed by that protocol's own <OnFail>. -->
  <!-- ── 动作点 / Action hooks ──
       两种写法都支持，可混用：
       Both forms are supported and can be combined:

       1) 内联 —— 直接写动作，不用为一两行动作单独建文件。
          Inline: write the actions right here; no need to create a file for one or two actions.
          内容原样交给 Pathfinder 解析，写法与动作文件完全一致：
          The content goes straight to Pathfinder, so the syntax is identical to an action file:
            · <Actions>           —— 其中动作**立即**逐个执行 / runs each action immediately
            · <ConditionalActions> —— 由条件决定何时执行；<Instantly> 在加载后立即触发，
                                      <OnConnect> / <HasFlags> 等则等待条件满足
                                      gated by a condition; <Instantly> fires on load, while
                                      <OnConnect> / <HasFlags> wait for their condition

       2) 路径 —— 引用一个动作文件（相对于扩展根）。
          Path: reference an action file, relative to the extension root.

       两者同时写时：先执行内联的那部分，再执行文件。
       When both are present the inline part runs first, then the file. -->
  <OnStart>Actions/crackStart.xml</OnStart>
  <OnComplete>Actions/crackSuccess.xml</OnComplete>

  <!-- ── 一次性效果 / One-shot effects ──
       已取消效果串字段：要开的端口由程序按"成功的协议"各自打开，
       其余效果（关端口 / 加减防火墙 / 代理 / 解防火墙……）一律写在动作点里，
       用普通动作文件表达即可，不必再学一套效果串语法。
       There are no effect-string fields any more. Ports are opened by the program for each
       successful protocol; every other effect goes into an action hook as a normal action file. -->

</PortHackV2Config>

<!--
    ============================================================
    变体 / Variants（把对应行放进上面的根元素或某个 <Protocol> 里）
    Variants (put the line into the root element or into a <Protocol>)
    ============================================================

    [必定失败 —— 剧情用 / Always fails, for story use]
      在某个 <Protocol> 里写 / Put <Rng>0</Rng> inside a <Protocol>:
      <Rng>0</Rng>

    [必定成功 —— 最简单 / Always succeeds, simplest form]
      省略 <Rng> / Omit <Rng>

    [单协议 / Single protocol]
      <Protocols> 里只放一个 <Protocol> / Put a single <Protocol> inside <Protocols>

    [不给管理员权限 —— 只开端口 / No admin, just open the port]
      省略 <TakeAdmin>（等价于 false）/ Omit <TakeAdmin> (same as false)

    [程序跨节点常驻 / Keep running across nodes]
      <AutoExitOnLeave>false</AutoExitOnLeave>

    [跳过进度条，直接演出 / Skip the progress bar]
      <TimeIfSuccess>0</TimeIfSuccess>

    [无任何前置要求，打开即可破解 / No prerequisites at all]
      删掉 <RequireOpenPortsBefore> / <RequireSolveFirewall> / <RequireProxyOverload>
      Remove those three elements.

    [总时长很短，但想让急刹看得清 / Very short total time, but a visible brake]
      总时长不够时急刹会自动截断（并保证起转至少有一点时长）。
      原型阶段想看完整的 1.7s 急刹，就把 <Time> 加到至少 2.7 左右。
      The brake is truncated when the total time is short. To see the full 1.7s brake,
      raise <Time> to roughly 2.7 or more.

    [换一个立体 / Use a different solid]
      <Polyhedron>Icosahedron</Polyhedron>

    [动作点写成内联 / Action hook written inline]
      不用建文件，直接写在钩子里（同样可挂在协议级的 <OnStart> / <OnComplete> / <OnFail>）：
      No file needed - write it straight into the hook (works on protocol-level hooks too):
      <OnStart>
        <Actions>
          <TerminalWrite Text="bypassing firewall..." />
          <PortControl TargetID="targetNode" Protocol="ssh" DisplayName="SSH" PortNum="22" />
        </Actions>
      </OnStart>

    [动作点内联 + 条件 / Action hook inline with a condition]
      <ConditionalActions> 里的条件满足后才执行；<Instantly> 是"加载后立即触发"：
      Gated by the condition inside <ConditionalActions>; <Instantly> fires as soon as it loads:
      <OnComplete>
        <ConditionalActions>
          <Instantly>
            <TerminalWrite Text="crack complete" />
          </Instantly>
        </ConditionalActions>
      </OnComplete>

    [内联与文件同时用 / Inline and file together]
      先跑内联部分，再跑文件：
      The inline part runs first, then the file:
      <OnComplete>Actions/crackSuccess.xml
        <Actions><TerminalWrite Text="done" /></Actions>
      </OnComplete>

    [起转用绝对秒数而不是比例 / Absolute ramp-up instead of a ratio]
      <SpinUpTime>0.5</SpinUpTime>

    [换强调色 —— 预设 / Another accent colour, preset]
      <AccentColor>Riptide</AccentColor>

    [换强调色 —— 动态彩虹 / Another accent colour, dynamic rainbow]
      <AccentColor>Rainbow</AccentColor>

    [强调色留空 = 白色 / Empty accent = white]
      省略 <AccentColor> / Omit <AccentColor>

    [调低内存占用 / Lower the RAM cost]
      <RamCost>30</RamCost>
      留空时是 246（与原版 PortHack 一致）。目标机可用内存不足时程序无法启动。
      Empty means 246 (same as vanilla PortHack). The program will not start if the target
      does not have enough free RAM.
-->
